abstract: >-
  110 buyer questions from five Singapore industries (dental and aesthetics,
  family law, tuition, B2B SaaS, e-commerce) put to ChatGPT (OpenAI Responses
  API, gpt-5.5 with web search, approximate location Singapore) and, in round 1,
  also to Google AI Mode through a third-party SERP API. Round 1 (60 questions)
  produced 526 citations (307 ChatGPT, 219 AI Mode); round 2 (50 questions,
  ChatGPT only) produced 241. Includes the questions, every cited URL with its
  order in the answer, ChatGPT answer texts, annotations of 92 cited pages and
  a catalogue of 46 cited-page types. Google AI Mode answer text, Google organic
  result lists and copies of third-party pages are not included.
keywords:
  - generative engine optimization
